  "[action] Wang Lung works the soil with his sons.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is so and I am ashamed, for they are so proud and so mean and they care so little for their father and their land. And it is so and I will not live in the town any longer and I will not live with them.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now, I will not have my house thus. You have no cause to be ashamed of your family.\"",
